; ATTREQ 1 (0.8.1-PT17, #941; docs/adr/0056, point 3): Enter keeps 1, a value other than
; 0 or 1 is refused as by the other values of the session (PEDITACCEPT, TRIMEXTENDMODE).
; With 1, a block whose attributes are all Constant or Preset (FISSO) and a block without
; attributes (VUOTO) ask nothing: no "Enter attribute values" (point 3 of the work); the
; Preset SERIE takes its default. An empty prompt shows the tag (ETICHETTA). A Verify
; value changed at the second prompt is the one kept (VERIFICA). Undo and redo of the
; insertion with its attribute.
; blocchi.dxf is handwritten: four blocks, each with the ATTDEFs said above (VUOTO: one line).
; ~box (docs/adr/0022): LiberationSans-Regular.ttf of resources/fonts, read with a small
; reader of its head, hhea, OS/2, cmap and hmtx tables: cap height 1409, ascent 1854,
; descent -434. An ATTDEF shows its tag; an ATTRIB is its ATTDEF moved by the insertion
; point (docs/adr/0045, point 6; docs/adr/0031, point 2: both points move).
OPEN
blocchi.dxf
ATTREQ

ATTREQ
2
1
-INSERT
FISSO
0,0
1

0
-INSERT
VUOTO
20,0
1

0
; cambia con #941
-INSERT
ETICHETTA
40,0
1

0
2
-INSERT
VERIFICA
60,0
1

0
230V
400V
U
REDO
